    Authors: empira Software GmbH
    Description: 'PDFsharp is the Open Source .NET library that easily creates and
      processes PDF documents on the fly from any .NET language. The same drawing
      routines can be used to create PDF documents, draw on the screen, or send output
      to any printer.


      This is the PDFsharp PDF Core package. See Project
      Information for details.'
