    Authors: Syncfusion Inc.
    Description: "The Syncfusion Essential PDF is a .NET standard PDF library that
      enables your .NET core applications to read, write, and manipulate existing
      PDF documents. It has various features such table creation, PDF form creation
      and filling, digital signature, and advanced PDF encryption.\n\t\t\n\t\tIt
