  - Id: HtmlRenderer.PdfSharp
    Version: 1.5.0.6
    Authors: Arthur Teplitzki
    Description: "PDF document generator from HTML snippet, 100% managed (C#), High
      performance library using PdfSharp.\n\n      Features and Benefits:\n     
      ---\n      * 100% managed code depends only on PdfSharp library, no ActiveX,
      no MSHTML.\n      * Extensive HTML 4.01 and CSS level 2 specifications support.\n     
      * Support separating CSS from HTML by loading stylesheet code separately.\n     
      * Handles \"real world\" malformed HTML, it doesn't have to be XHTML.\n     
      * Supports .NET 2.0 or higher including Client Profile.\n      * Lightweight,
      only two DLLs (~300K).\n      * High performance and low memory footprint.\n     
      * Extendable and configurable."
