  - Id: Select.HtmlToPdf
    Version: 22.2.0
    Authors: SelectPdf
    Description: "SelectPdf Html To Pdf Converter for .NET - Community Edition is
      the free version of the powerful html to pdf converter available in SelectPdf
      Library for .NET.\n\nThe converter offers a lot of powerful options (convert
      any web page to pdf, convert any html string to pdf, html5/css3/javascript
      support, headers and footers support, etc) and the only limitation is that
      it can generate pdf documents up to 5 pages long.\n\nFree Html to Pdf Converter
